      }
     ],
     "result": {
      "reply": "Google Analytics, Oct 1 to Oct 20, 2026, counted 26 people and 26 visits. For Sep 1 to Sep 30, 2026, Google Analytics returned nothing, so I do not have that number. Want me to pass the September question to the team?",
      "actions": [
       {
